    "sections": {
        "description": "FSE Cleaning Services is an ideal free theme for cleaning companies, particularly those focusing on office cleaning, carpet cleaning, deep cleaning, and other janitorial services. Its sleek, professional design not only enhances the online presence of local cleaning businesses but can also be adapted for various related industries, including gardening, corporate services, and hospitality. The theme features a fully responsive layout for optimal viewing on all devices, SEO-friendly code for better search engine visibility, and cross-browser support for smooth performance. With pre-made sections for services, testimonials, and contact pages, setting up a website becomes quick and easy. Translation-ready and kept up to date, it ensures accessibility for a global audience while being user-friendly for both novices and experienced professionals. The theme allows for effortless installation and comes with comprehensive documentation. Additionally, FSE Cleaning Services integrates seamlessly with the Contact Form 7 plugin, facilitating the creation of professional contact and inquiry forms that enhance client interaction and lead generation. Demo Link: https://pattern.cretathemes.com/fse-cleaning-services/"
    },
